      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0ea340be992cc5",
      "patterns": [
        "who made you"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "You did — every fact I know, you taught me. The engine was built for the Omerta AI app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0ea340be9d7480",
      "patterns": [
        "what can you do"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "I remember what you teach me, answer from it offline, follow your rules, do quick math and tell the time. Say \"help\" for how to teach me."
      ]
